# linkml-runtime
[![Pyversions](https://img.shields.io/pypi/pyversions/linkml-runtime.svg)](https://pypi.python.org/pypi/linkml-runtime)
![](https://github.com/linkml/linkml/workflows/Build/badge.svg)
